  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\">개인적으로 특수상대성이론에서<strong> \"질량에너지 등가원리의 필연성\"</strong>을 설명하기가 쉽지 않았습니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\">저는 대략 2가지로 설명합니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><strong>1.일-에너지 원리에서 물체에 일을 해준 만큼&nbsp;운동에너지로 변하는 고전적인 법칙이 있으나 상대론적으로는 속도가 무한히 커질 수 없고, 해준 에너지의 일부가 질량으로 변한다.</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><strong>2.<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">시공간이 상대적이므로 속도의 함수인&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">운동에너지를 상대론적으로 구해야 한다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><strong>&nbsp; 일-에너지 원리에서 해준 일의 일부가 속도 증가가 아니라 질량 증가로 나타난다.</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">그래도 짧은 설명으로 명확하지는 않아 얼버무리고 넘어가는 수준이 됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">결국 수학적인게 깔끔해서 찾아보다가</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">고등학교 수준에서 증명한 내용을 발견하여 공유합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">물론 수업에서 할수는 없겠지만, 똘똘한 아이에게 도움을 주거나 개인적인 만족감을 얻을 수 있겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 13.33px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial;\">책 &lt;빛의 속도로 이해하는 상대성 이론 - 이종필&gt;을 읽고 정리하였습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>부족한 부분 말씀주시면, 고맙겠습니다.^&amp;^</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9998B1505F06AFD421\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"992\" width=\"992\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"질량에너지등가식_유도하기001.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_9998B1505F06AFD421F9AD\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevQm%26dataid%3D5%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20200709092244&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile288.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9947204E5F06B00B31D83A')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 질량에너지등가식_유도하기.pdf</a></p><p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
